---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { businessLd } from '../../schema';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
import hero from '../../assets/images/2023/2022USDressageFinals/USDressageFinals-4.jpg';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Where does Natalie teach and train?',
    a: `Natalie rides and trains out of ${SITE.barn.name} in ${SITE.barn.city}, Missouri, convenient to St. Louis, Wildwood, O'Fallon, Chesterfield and the rest of St. Charles County.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'Who does Natalie work with?',
    a: 'Riders and horses at every level, from those just starting dressage to competitors working toward regional championships and the US Dressage Finals.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is Natalie taking new students?',
    a: 'Natalie keeps a limited schedule these days. Openings for lessons and training come up from time to time, so please get in touch to ask about current availability and pricing.',
  },
];

const faqLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a },
  })),
};
---

<Page
  title="Dressage Training in St. Louis"
  heading="Dressage Training & Lessons in St. Louis"
  eyebrow="Training"
  lede={`Lessons, training rides and show support with Natalie Hammond at ${SITE.barn.name} in ${SITE.barn.city}, Missouri.`}
  description="Dressage training and lessons with Natalie Hammond, an FEI rider and German Bereiter, at Paradiso Farm in Wentzville, Missouri, serving the St. Louis area."
  keywords="dressage training, dressage lessons, dressage trainer, st louis, saint louis, wentzville, wildwood, st charles county, missouri"
  hero={hero}
  heroAlt="Natalie and Rufus at the 2022 US Dressage Finals"
  heroPosition="50% 40%"
  jsonLd={[businessLd, faqLd]}
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Finding a dressage trainer who will work with you and your horse is an important part of becoming a rider who
      earns high marks in the show ring. Natalie works with riders and horses of all levels to raise the bar on their
      performance at home or in competition.
    </p>
    <p>
      Natalie competed at FEI levels in Germany and Australia, completed her Bereiter training in Warendorf, Germany,
      and has qualified for and competed at the US Dressage Finals. Read more in <a href="/about/">her bio</a> and
      <a href="/blog/natalie-hammond-cv">CV</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Training options</h2>
    <p>
      Natalie keeps a <strong>limited schedule</strong>, with availability for:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Private dressage lessons</li>
      <li>Full and partial training for your horse</li>
      <li>Show preparation and show-day assistance</li>
      <li>Clinics</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <dl class="faq">
      {
        faqs.map((f) => (
          <>
            <dt>{f.q}</dt>
            <dd>{f.a}</dd>
          </>
        ))
      }
    </dl>

    <h2>Ask about availability</h2>
    <p>
      Please <a href="/contact/">contact Natalie</a> for current availability and pricing, and with any questions about
      dressage training in the St. Louis area. Looking for a place for your horse? See
      <a href="/boarding/">dressage boarding</a>.
    </p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Contact Natalie</a></p>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .faq dt {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .faq dd {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
